              <chunks count="1">
                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scores how well a 6-axis robot reaches points, with the tool turned through several rotations about its axis. A rotation scores 0 out of reach or near a singularity, and up to 1 as the wrist moves away from the J5 = 0 flip boundary, where linear moves can flip the wrist. Red is 0, amber 0.5, green 1 and grey out of reach.</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">8aa93eb2-9020-4f64-9794-80abdc8a762a</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Reachability</item>
